  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova yero ni Musa, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim agwara ario iri mi mola ma tar; timgi ku tic m’afoda: man ibilwong’o kudo udul, man mi woth mi gonjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma gibikudhogi, udul ceke bicokri gigi i beng’i i dhugola mi hema mi cokri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek gikudho acel kende, judongomawijo, ma wi rubanga mir Israel, gibilund cokri i beng’i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma wukudho girapoya gonjo m’ubedo i ng’et kagonjo ma yo nyangu bitugo woth migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma wukudho girapoya mir arionde, gonjo m’ubedo i ng’et kagonjo ma yor ariwa ma piny bitugo woth migi; gibikudho girapoya pi woth migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kinde ma jubicoko cokri karacelo, wubikudho, ento wubikudho girapoya ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wot Harun, ma julam, gibikudho agwara: man gibibedo iwu ni cik mi nja cil ni dhanum’utuk mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma wucidho ba lwiny i ng’om mu wi jadegi ma sendowu, wubilund kudho girapoya kud agwara; e jubipoi piwu i wang’ Yehova Mungu mu, e wubiboth ni judegi mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nindo mi mutoro mu bende, man i agba mu ma juketho, man i thekri mi dwi mu, wubikudho agwara wi lam m’awang’a mu, man wi lam mi girathiera mi kwiocwiny mu; e gibibedo iwu ni poi i wang’ Mungu mu; an a Yehova Mungu mu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre i rundi mir arionde, i dwi mir arionde, i ceng’ pier arionde mi dwi, nia afuru tingre malu ku wi hema mi lembatuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nyithindho mir Israel gitugo woth calku woth migi kud i langa mi Sinai; man afuru bedo i langa mi Paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gikwong’o woth migi calku lembang’ola pa Yehova ni kum Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ma kwong’ane abera mi gonjo mi nyithindho pa Yuda tugo woth calkud udul migi: man Nacon ma wod Aminadab ni wi udul pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Nethanel ma wod Zuar ni wi udul mi suru mi nyithindho pa Isakar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Eliab ma wod Helon ni wi udul mi suru mi nyithindho pa Zebulun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jugonyo hema piny; man wot Gercon ku wot Merari, m’uyeyo hema, gitugo woth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abera mi gonjo pa Ruben gitugo woth calkud udul migi: man Elizur ma wod Cedeur ni wi udul pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Celumiel ma wod Zuricadai ni wi udul mi suru mi nyithindho pa Simeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Eliasaf ma wod Deuel ni wi udul mi suru mi nyithindho pa Gad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Jukohathi tugo woth, ma gibeyeyo kamaleng’: man jumange giketho hema cungo ma fodi giwok ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abera mi gonjo mi nyithindho pa Efraim gitugo woth calkud udul migi: man Elicama ma wod Amihud ni wi udul pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Gamaliel ma wod Pedazur ni wi udul mi suru mi nyithindho pa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Abidan ma wod Gideoni ni wi udul mi suru mi nyithindho pa Benyamin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abera mi gonjo mi nyithindho pa Dan, m’ebedo cen ni gonjo ceke, utugo woth calkud udul migi: man Ahiezer ma wod Amicadai ni wi udul pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Pagiel ma wod Okran ni wi udul mi suru mi nyithindho pa Acer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ahira ma wod Enan ni wi udul mi suru mi nyithindho pa Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woth mi nyithindho mir Israel ubedo kumeni calkud udul migi; e gitugo woth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa wacu ni Hobab, ma wod Reuel ma Jamidiani, ma jalkwaru Musa kumae, Wabecidho i ka ma Yehova wacu pire kumae, Abimie iwu: bin wacidhu wakudu, man wabitimi ber; kum Yehova yero ber pir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ire kumae, Abicidho ngo; ento abidok i ng’om para ma dhe, man ba wat para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu kumae, Akwei, kud iwekwa; kum calu ing’eyo maram wabigonjo ko i langa, e ibibedo iwa kaka wang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebibedo, tek wacidho wakudu, eyo, ebibedo, nia bero ma tek Yehova bitimo iwa, e wabitimo eca i beng’i bende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
