              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gitugo woth ugambre kum got pa Yehova woth mi ceng’ adek e sanduk mi lembariba pa Yehova cidho i wang’gi woth mi ceng’ adek kara uyeny igi kayom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
